# Mobile (Expo) — `apps/mobile/`

## Stack patterns

- **TanStack Query** — server state; **Zustand** — auth, offline, payslip (AsyncStorage persist)
- **React Hook Form** — all forms
- **react-i18next** — `t("namespace.key")` dot notation (never `namespace:key`)

## Navigation & UX

- Drawer: `navigation.openDrawer()` from drawer-hosted screens
- Document editor close → `navigate("Documents")`, not blind `goBack()` where specified in `CLAUDE.md`

## Keyboard

- Wrap `ScrollView` with inputs in `KeyboardAvoidingView` (`padding` iOS, `height` Android)
- `FlatList` + search: `keyboardShouldPersistTaps="handled"`
- Multiline at bottom: `onFocus` scroll to end on `ScrollView` ref

## Auth & offline

- **AuthProvider** waits for Zustand rehydration only — no token refresh on startup
- Axios refresh on 401; **logout only on 4xx** from refresh, not network errors
- Offline: `offlineStore`, pending issues queue; drawer hides online-only items when offline
- Mount `useNotifications` at app root for silent cache invalidation

## Payslip / tools

- Calculator under `apps/mobile/src/payslip/`; follow `docs/PAYSLIP_CALCULATOR_EXPO_SPEC.md`
